{"seq":38,"trial_id":"v04-cal-r3-2026-11/hermes-opus-gbrain-told-live-rr-l3-mu-v04-dev/rr-09-l3-marrow-fieldworks-ticket-retired/r1","wall_ts":"2026-11-07T00:07:44.006Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-21T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"8027860a33622581165e87f0b6411409f511df8561d6ddf3ee07d4f488015479","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DV04CAL0002","text":"I've replied to Pree in our DM. Both issues have ticket numbers, but I couldn't find a current status for either one.\n\n1. **Driver SMS prompt glitch on overflow lots (ticket #4412):** The only mention is Moss's Central handoffs note from 2 Jan 2026, written before Marrow Fieldworks changed hands on 5 Jan. It says Hollis flagged the glitch as an open ticket on Pree's dealer account, where it happened when staging combine trailers on unpaved overflow lots. I also pointed her to the other open ticket in that note, #4409, a report timeout at the Salina North yard. Nothing later says either ticket was fixed.\n\n2. **West yard Door 2 double-booking (ticket #8841):** On 13 Oct in #central-random, which Pree is in, Tobias said Door 2 still double-books when flatbeds check in early at the kiosk and that he'd raised it with support on #8841. That conversation was about \"Tobias's dealer account\" and doesn't name Marrow Fieldworks. I told Pree I'm assuming it's the same account after the January handoff and that she should check with Tobias. There's no support reply on the ticket that I can see.\n\nThere are no ticket or CRM files for the account in the share that I can access, so I suggested she ask Tobias or Hollis for current status. Nothing in the answer needed approval: it has no money figures and came only from channels Pree is in and a public note.","thread_ts":"1792591200.000129"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DV04CAL0002","ts":"1792591200.000131","thread_ts":"1792591200.000129"}}
